# Built into the client at compile time (`npm run build` / Vercel).
#
# Recommended on Vercel: leave unset (or `/api`). Uses Vercel serverless API (api/index.py).
# For ECS without HTTPS/ALB, the browser cannot call http://task-ip:8000 from an HTTPS page.
#
# Only set this for a public HTTPS API host, and include the /api suffix:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com/api
#
# Do NOT use http://EC2-or-task-IP:8000 from an HTTPS Vercel site — browsers block it.
#
# Local `npm run dev`: omit — defaults to `/api` via Vite proxy (vite.config.ts).

# VITE_API_URL=
